#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel2_3)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpageexplanation.ui:17
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>The KDE Wallet system stores your data in a <span "
"style=\" font-style:italic;\">wallet</span> file on your local hard disk. "
"The data is encrypted using your chosen method: the Blowfish algorithm with "
"your password as the key, or GPG with an encryption key. When a wallet is "
"opened, the wallet manager will launch and display an icon in the system "
"tray. You can use this application to manage all of your wallets. It even "
"permits you to drag-and-drop wallets and their contents, allowing you to "
"easily copy a wallet to a remote system.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body><p>De KDE-Portmonni-System späichert Är Donnéeën an engem "
"<span style=\" font-style:italic;\">Portmonni</span>-Fichier op Ärer lokaler "
"Festplack. D'Donnéeë ginn mat der Method verschlësselt, déi Dir gewielt "
"hutt: dem Blowfish-Algorithmus mat Ärem Passwuert als Schlëssel, oder GPG "
"mat engem Verschlësselungsschlëssel. Wann e Portmonni opgemaach gëtt, start "
"de Portmonni-Manager a weist en Icon an der Systemleescht. Mat dëser "
"Applikatioun kënnt Dir all Är Portmonnien verwalten. Dir kënnt souguer "
"Portmonnien an hiren Inhalt mat Zéien a Fale verréckelen, sou datt Dir e "
"Portmonni einfach op e Fernsystem kopéiere kënnt.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_3)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpagegpgkey.ui:24
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>The GPG-based wallet uses a GPG encryption key to "
"securely encrypt data on disk. The key must be available when the wallet is "
"decrypted or your wallet will not be accessible. For example, if you choose "
"a SmartCard-based encryption key, you will be prompted to insert it and "
"enter its associated PIN when attempting to open the wallet. <span style=\" "
"font-weight:600;\">Note:</span> this list contains only &quot;ultimate-"
"level&quot; trusted keys.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body><p>De GPG-baséierte Portmonni benotzt e GPG-"
"Verschlësselungsschlëssel, fir d'Donnéeën op der Disk sécher ze "
"verschlësselen. De Schlëssel muss verfügbar sinn, wann de Portmonni "
"entschlësselt gëtt, soss kënnt Dir net op Äre Portmonni zougräifen. Wann Dir "
"zum Beispill e SmartCard-baséierte Verschlësselungsschlëssel wielt, gitt Dir "
"beim Opmaache vum Portmonni gefrot, en anzestiechen an de PIN dozou "
"anzeginn. <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Notiz:</span> dës Lëscht enthält "
"nëmme Schlësselen, deenen &quot;ultimate-level&quot; vertraut gëtt.</p></"
"body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpagegpgkey.ui:42
#, kde-format
msgid "Select GPG encryption key:"
msgstr "GPG-Verschlësselungsschlëssel wielen:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_2)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpagegpgkey.ui:81
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Unable to locate at least one GPG encryption key. KDE Wallet needs a GPG "
"encryption key to securely store passwords or other sensitive data on disk. "
"If you still want to setup a GPG-based wallet, exit this wizard, create an "
"encryption key and return to this wizard. Otherwise, you can return to the "
"previous page and select Blowfish encryption, which does not require an "
"encryption key."
msgstr ""
"Et konnt keen eenzege GPG-Verschlësselungsschlëssel fonnt ginn. De KDE-"
"Portmonni brauch e GPG-Verschlësselungsschlëssel, fir Passwierder oder aner "
"sensibel Donnéeën sécher op der Disk ze späicheren. Wann Dir trotzdeem e GPG-"
"baséierte Portmonni ariichte wëllt, verlooss dësen Assistent, leet e "
"Verschlësselungsschlëssel un a kommt zréck an dësen Assistent. Soss kënnt "
"Dir op déi vireg Säit zréckgoen an d'Blowfish-Verschlësselung wielen, déi "
"kee Verschlësselungsschlëssel brauch."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel2)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpageintro.ui:30
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Welcome to KWallet, the KDE Wallet System. KWallet allows you to store your "
"passwords and other sensitive information on disk in an encrypted file, "
"preventing unauthorized access. This wizard will help you set up KWallet for "
"the first time."
msgstr ""
"Wëllkomm bei KWallet, dem KDE-Portmonni-System. Mat KWallet kënnt Dir Är "
"Passwierder an aner sensibel Informatiounen an engem verschlësselte Fichier "
"op der Disk späicheren, wat onerlaabten Zougrëff verhënnert. Dësen Assistent "
"hëlleft Iech, KWallet fir d'éischt anzeriichten."

