#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel3)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpagepasswordgpg.ui:17
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Various applications may request access to the KDE "
"wallet to store passwords, web form data, or cookies. To allow this, enable "
"the wallet and choose an encryption method. </p><p>GPG encryption is more "
"secure, but you must have at least one encryption key configured on your "
"system.</p><p>If you choose the classic format, note that the password <span "
"style=\" font-style:italic;\">cannot</span> be recovered if lost and grants "
"full access to all information stored in the wallet.</p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Verschidden Applikatioune kënnen Zougrëff op de KDE-"
"Portmonni ufroen, fir Passwierder, Webformular-Donnéeën oder Cookien ze "
"späicheren. Fir dat z'erlaben, aktivéiert de Portmonni a wielt eng "
"Verschlësselungsmethod. </p><p>D'GPG-Verschlësselung ass méi sécher, mee Dir "
"musst op Ärem System mindestens ee Verschlësselungsschlëssel ageriicht hunn."
"</p><p>Wann Dir dat klassescht Format wielt, bedenkt, datt d'Passwuert sech "
"bei Verloscht <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">net</span> erëmhole léisst "
"a vollen Zougrëff op all d'Informatiounen am Portmonni gëtt.</p></body></"
"html>"

